    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "A fund begins with $\\$30\\,000$. It earns 6% p.a., compounded monthly.\nAt the end of each month, $\\$1500$ is withdrawn. Find how much remains after 1 year. Give your answer to the nearest cent.",
